stdout:
stderr:
Usage of score:
  -json
    	print JSON output
  -loki string
    	Loki base URL; required to measure log/trace correlation with --service
  -prometheus string
    	Prometheus base URL (default "http://localhost:9090")
  -service string
    	target service.name; enables service identity and log/trace correlation dimensions
  -tempo string
    	Tempo base URL; resolves a correlated trace ID as detail for the correlation dimension
